Emission controls:
* Additional combustion control, including an even more efficient variable-geometry turbocharging system, cooled (enhanced) [[exhaust gas recirculation]] (EGR), and closed crankcase ventilation to reduce [[nitrogen oxide]]s (NOx)
* Additional exhaust control, including oxidizing catalyst and new [[diesel particulate filter]] (DPF) to reduce soot and [[particulate]] matter
* Increased-capacity cooling system
* New engine control software
* Use of low-ash engine oil (CJ-4)

Applications:
